bowler or new to the game, \"Bowliverse\" offers a fresh and captivating way to enjoy this beloved sport.\nGame Overview\n\n\"Bowliverse\" is a cutting-edge VR game that redefines the bowling experience by placing players in a vibrant cosmic arena. The game challenges your precision, skill, and timing as you aim to score points by knocking down pins in various celestial-themed lanes. Each game session offers a unique adventure, filled with stunning visuals and dynamic gameplay.", "short_description": "Bowliverse: The Ultimate VR Bowling Experience\n\nWelcome to \"Bowliverse,\" where the classic sport of bowling transcends the ordinary and enters a realm of immersive virtual reality. Prepare to embark on a cosmic adventure that transforms traditional bowling into an exhilarating and futuristic experience. Whether you're a seasoned bowler or new to the game, \"Bowliverse\" offers a fresh and captivating way to enjoy this beloved sport."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/bowliverse/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "KH Invention", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/bowliverse", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8715910298425928"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []